    "ornament": "gingerbread timber fretwork and latticework on deep verandas with tall windows and doors; white colonnaded porticos and domed pavilions on civic buildings; painted murals and bright signboards on concrete facades; red-and-green cast-iron work on the Marche en Fer.",
